<Slide style={{width: '1280px', height: '720px', background: '#FFFFFF', padding: '0px', fontFamily: 'Microsoft YaHei'}}><Box style={{position: 'absolute', top: 0, left: 0, width: 1280, height: 10, background: '#1E4FA8'}}></Box><Box style={{position: 'absolute', top: 120, left: 90, width: 1100, gap: 20, alignItems: 'center'}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#3D7BD9', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.2, textAlign: 'center' }}>小　结</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 42, color: '#0E3F8C', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.2, textAlign: 'center' }}>分层求解：以能力标定筛选规模</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 42, color: '#0E3F8C', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.2, textAlign: 'center' }}>以组合优化保证质量</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 22, color: '#1E4FA8', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.35, textAlign: 'center' }}>进化只搜「归属 × 顺序」，可行性、终点机巢与成本余量分别交给构造、精确解与确定性精修。</Text></Box><Box style={{position: 'absolute', top: 470, left: 190, width: 900, background: '#F7F9FC', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', padding: 15, gap: 6}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#4A5568', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.3, textAlign: 'center' }}>任务分配：把「这一周期飞哪些、谁飞、按什么顺序、落哪个巢」变成可求解的四类决策。</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#4A5568', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.3, textAlign: 'center' }}>方法：选择缩空间 → 选择性 MUAS 精优化 → 滚动状态继承，压住组合规模。</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#4A5568', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.3, textAlign: 'center' }}>第二阶段：编码保持最紧的 N，每个环节都能单独验证、单独替换。</Text></Box><Box style={{position: 'absolute', top: 620, left: 90, width: 1100, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center'}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#8B97A8', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.35, textAlign: 'left' }}>公式与口径可回溯 Chapter3_README.md / methods 实现</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 26, color: '#1E4FA8', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.2, textAlign: 'left' }}>请老师批评指正</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#8B97A8', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.35, textAlign: 'left' }}>2026 年 11 月</Text></Box></Slide>